WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.071
Think of kVp and mAs as two different controls.

2
00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:09.014
kVp primarily changes photon energy and penetration.

3
00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:14.085
mAs primarily changes the number of x-ray photons produced.

4
00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:19.156
Increasing mAs increases receptor exposure in a direct relationship.

5
00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:28.170
Changing kVp affects penetration and also influences receptor exposure, so technique changes should be made thoughtfully.
